# What the prepare-release job installs on top of the package's own test extra.
# git-cliff writes the changelog section from the commits since the last tag,
# and an exact version is what keeps a section from being written by whatever
# the day's latest happens to be.
#
# prepare.txt is compiled from this file and is what the workflow installs.
# Dependabot watches this directory and bumps the compiled file. A version
# written inside a `run:` line is invisible to it, which is why the pin lives
# here.
#
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --no-header \
#     --output-file=.github/requirements/prepare.txt .github/requirements/prepare.in
git-cliff
